WEBVTT

00:12:57.815 --> 00:13:00.025
African Americans lost three years.

00:13:01.151 --> 00:13:03.403
And we should be focusing
on reducing the gap

00:13:03.445 --> 00:13:05.614
between what we call
health span and lifespan.

00:13:05.614 --> 00:13:07.282
The amount of time that we spend

00:13:07.324 --> 00:13:11.203
that is fundamentally
healthy and full capacity.

00:13:11.245 --> 00:13:13.330
I think we all agree
that these are problems

00:13:13.330 --> 00:13:14.623
that are worth solving

00:13:14.665 --> 00:13:18.544
and we have the tools at our disposal
right now to solve them.

00:13:18.585 --> 00:13:22.047
If the first great revolution
in human health

00:13:22.089 --> 00:13:25.551
was extending the overall
average human life,

00:13:25.592 --> 00:13:29.721
the second should be
about closing the gaps.

00:13:29.763 --> 00:13:31.056
Thank you very much.